{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_bison_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_bison_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "充实的假期",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bison_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe50fbd4a8f85eb06e045d584f94af0df86dd9ec20d37ef7bb5c4c5ff8676697",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "巴特勒，明天就要放年假了，还是早点回家休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "没关系，少爷，就剩最后一点事情了，马上就能做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "少爷，这么晚了您怎么还不睡？加了这么多天班，您也应该趁此机会好好休息一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "本来是这么打算的......但是......父亲他近来想要扩展在哥伦比亚的业务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "我想......自己也应该提前做些什么，配合父亲的脚步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "少爷，我记得老爷他只是在饭桌上提了这么一句而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "如果等他正式告知我再做，基本上，也就没有我能出力的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "......唉，少爷辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "为了能在将来接过父亲身上的担子，再怎么辛苦也不为过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "这么晚了，拜松，你在和巴特勒聊什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "没什么，父亲，我们在聊假期计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "老爷，请问您对少爷的假期计划知情吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "我并不知情，这小子最近忙得我也见不到几面。所以你有什么想法吗，拜松？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "呃......我想学点新东西，或者为明年要做的项目做准备，我还没想清楚，但总归是要找些事情做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "这可是假期啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "......拜松，如果非要找事情做的话，去见见你在企鹅物流的朋友吧。我从哥伦比亚带了很多东西回来，你可以挑几样作为礼物送过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "好，没问题，父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "行了，早点休息吧，拜松。明天起早点，没有巴特勒帮忙，你得自己准备礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "嗯，我自己一个人可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "我可以留下来为少爷打包好礼物再走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "不不不，你还是按时回家陪陪家人吧，巴特勒。辛苦一年，这是你难得的休假，不用为我加班了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "何况......我想父亲的本意肯定不是让我单纯地拜访朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "和企鹅物流的朋友相处久了，偶尔也会忘记，他们其实是我们的合作对象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "父亲应该就是在指点我，一段合作关系需要长时间的持续维护，不能因为已经熟稔，就不去在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "巴特勒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "text": "啊，没什么，我就是突然有些怀念夫人还在家的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "能天使，我们只是出门野餐，你为什么要带这么多把铳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "因为我们永远不知道下一秒来的是奶油三明治，还是突发事件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "呃，好重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可颂，你为什么带了那么多食物，我们只是去野餐，吃不了那么多的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不......今天天气很好，去野餐的人一定很多。\n我......可不能......错过......商机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯，你就不说点什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "哦，我劝过了，她不听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不必多说了，只要能够大赚一笔，\n这点、重量、算呃......什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（老天爷啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "拜松，你怎么今天来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "叨扰了，新年快乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "我带了些礼物给你们，不知道合不合你们的心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "哇，好漂亮的灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "欸，拜松？嘿嘿，既然来了，想不想和我们一起去公园野餐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "哈，你只是想找个人帮你搬东西吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "咳咳，谢谢可颂姐的邀请，但我只是趁假期空闲过来打个招呼，稍微坐坐就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可是，前段时间你一直在忙，我们好久都没有见面了。是事情没有做完要加班吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "其实，公司的事情已经处理妥当了，我只是不想因为假期就松懈下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "可假期不就是一个应该好好放松的时期吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "对啊，对啊。我为这次野餐特意准备了好看的新垫子，一起来嘛，拜松！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "可是我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "您好，请问有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "什么......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "好......虽然不理解，但是没问题，我们接受......嗯，好的，再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "谁来的电话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "是老板。情况有变，我们今天没法去野餐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不要啊，难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "嗯，看来是突发事件先到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "虽然很可惜，但还是不得不宣布，我们接到了一个紧急委托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空&能天使&可颂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "凑过来，我有话要说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "什么事啊？神神秘秘的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（看来她们的讨论很激烈......我是不是该识趣点。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "那个，如果大家有事的话，我就不打扰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "等一下，拜松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "这个委托还会麻烦到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "对，你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "事项一，来这家影音店买CD？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "这......不是应该交给空来做更为适合吗？我对音乐又没有什么深入研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，你好，请问这里有......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "嘘......小声点，大家都在听歌呢。想听什么就去架子上拿，那里什么都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "不能推荐推荐吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "一般情况下，来这里的人都不会问这种话，你就随便选一张吧，小朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "我成年了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "那挺好，那一片区域你也可以去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "那里有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "......我知道了，不打扰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "他戴上耳机了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的吗？太好了，我就知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是我最喜欢的店了，老板从来不会推销和问询，任你在他浩瀚的收藏中寻找自己心仪的唱片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有时候演出压力过大，我就会来这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "听起来是个让人放松的好地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "相信我啦，他一定会在这里彻底感受到放松的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "他把耳机放下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "啊......看来我进购的CD实在是太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "是我的话，就不会去碰那座岌岌可危的CD山，你到底堆多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "一年？两年？太久了......我实在是懒得收拾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "看来你需要一个人帮忙分拣这批CD。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "......是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（看来这就是我真正要做的事情了......真是的，也不把委托写得更清楚一点。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（听音乐......挺好，但不适合现在。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，请交给我做吧，我曾经做过分拣员，整理的货物可比这些CD复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "小伙子你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "相信我，我是专业的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "啊......等等，你打算怎么分类啊，小伙子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "发生什么事情了？喂？喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......店里的CD堆倒塌了，他在帮忙规整。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那听歌呢？他没有在听歌吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "看他那忙得热火朝天的样子，应该是顾不上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "唉......肩膀好酸，想不到老板店里的CD有那么多，随便买几张也不知道够不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "不过分拣工作的结果似乎还不错，看来这么长时间没做，手也没有变生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "让我看看，下一项委托是......在这家武器店狠狠杀价？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "这是给我的委托？怎么看都应该是给可颂姐的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么样，他进去了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，上次因为杀价太狠被这家店的老板列入黑名单，再也不许我登门购物。但那又如何呢？我还有别的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我想，那位委托人的目的并不是这个吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，难道你不觉得狠狠杀价非常解压吗？费尽心思与老板唇枪舌战一番，最后捧走胜利的果实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "相信我，他一定会因此而倍感轻松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "呵，希望如此，这样工作就能早点结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "哎哟，小伙子，光顾小店是想买些什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "等等，我有一张购物单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "嘿，嚯——这可不短啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "上面的东西各样都来一份，打包后我带走，麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "好嘞，账单给您，一共十六万，现金还是银行卡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（这价格......用得着杀价吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（......算了，毕竟是委托。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，能再便宜一些吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "小伙子，这话我就不爱听了，我们店可是出了名的物美价廉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "那算了吧，我去别家看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "啧，看你买了这么多，给你打个九折好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（九折......算“狠狠”吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "咳咳，小伙子，这已经是我的成本价了，不要太过分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（......或许可以用一些谈判桌上的技巧，虽然还不成熟，但讲个价应该足够了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，做生意还是诚信一些吧，这远远不到你的底线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "你个毛头小子知道什么？这些零件可都是来自哥伦比亚的进口货。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，这些东西虽然贴了哥伦比亚的牌子，但是一看切割工艺留下的痕迹就能辨识出，它们其实是产自玻利瓦尔的代工工厂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "你卖给我的价格远超货物的成本价，我大致估算了下，这些东西最多不超过六万龙门币。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "你在胡说些什么，我这些当然是正品零件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "你坚持？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "老板，你进货的时候可能被人骗了，这个牌子的货物一直交由我家的运输路线运送，不同批次、不同型号、不同厂商，我都一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "不要轻信别人啊，老板，这样怎么做生意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "你说我傻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "当然还有另一种可能，你不仅不傻，还很聪明，毕竟正品和低端贴牌代工货的价格差别真的很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "......你什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "一口价八万，除去各项成本开销，已经够你赚很多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "太狠了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "......你别哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "text": "呜......你太狠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "有人出来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，是不是有人自信满满、意气风发、昂首阔步，丢掉一身压力，带着满满的货物离开了店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不，是老板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "老板哭着跑出了店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要我说嘛，她们俩的计划都太复杂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要放松舒缓压力还不容易吗？派对啊派对，直接加入派对狂欢难道不是最简单的办法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你刚刚说什么？这里很吵，听不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我说，让他来参加派对是最直接的解压方法！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嘶......你太大声了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你现在可是在龙门除夕夜最大的派对现场，我不是怕你听不到嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么样？他来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（刚刚那个价格......说实话，是不是还能再压一压？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（看来我在谈判桌上还需要再多学点。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "哎哟！好、好多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（还差最后一项事务没有完成，把这份礼物送给派对里的某个人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "茫茫人海，上哪里去找啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（戴着铁面具，穿着威武的披风，浑身刀剑不入......这真的不是什么武侠小说中的人物吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "唉......信使的工作不就是迎难而上吗，加油吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我看见他扎进人群了，你确定你说的人他不会找到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然，这个人物是我依据以前看的小说《铁面剑客行》捏造的，谁会在龙门的除夕夜派对这么穿啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又不是安魂节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "......她们不会是在捉弄我吧，这里谁会这么穿啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "要不回去再确认一下好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "难道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "她们居然不是骗我！真的出现了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "先生，先生！请留步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "嗯，你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "先生您好，我是信使，这有一份您的快递，请签收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "有意思，把快递送到这里来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "是呀，让我在如此盛大的派对中寻找收件人，刚开始我还以为是搞错了，万幸，还是找到您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "您确认完，记得签个字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "是什么东西啊？想不到出差在外也能收到快递，什么物流这么厉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "（吞咽口水）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "（攥紧拳头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "（浑身颤抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "您还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "你到底是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......很不幸，他找到你说的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么可能？我不相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "有一个卡西米尔的骑士在人群中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......怎么可能？我不理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你在包裹里到底放了什么东西？那家伙拆开包裹后脸色很不对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......我不记得，随手摸个东西就放进盒子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等我找找......好像是可颂进购的一批精制箭头，我随便抓了一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（这有草丛......太好了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "奇怪，明明看那小子是往这边走的，怎么不见了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "可恶......到底去哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿铠甲的骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "我到底是做了什么？怎么会让无胄盟追我追到龙门......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "呼......走了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "怎么突然就动起手来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "算了，不管了，跑了这么久，终于甩掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "......累死了，我得、我得找个地方歇歇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轻轻靠在一棵树上，拜松仔细思索着今天发生的事情，试图从中寻找一些端倪来解释这个荒唐混乱的局面。\n但此刻，他又不是很想思考。\n或许是除夕夜的风有些冷，他的脑袋被吹得一片空白。\n或许是一整天的事有些怪，他的思绪被搅成一团乱麻。\n或许，什么都不想，就这么放任自己靠在树旁也挺好。\n直到一颗球滚到他脚下，将他从愣怔中唤醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，老哥，可以帮我们把球踢回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老哥，愣着干什么？要一起玩吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "......这片沙地没有球门，草皮也很稀疏......怎么踢啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就这么踢啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "可标记线也没有，到时候怎么算分，犯规行为要怎么判定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "犯规？我们不讲那些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拜松突然想起，他已经很久没有踢过球了。\n还没毕业，他就被父亲塞进了公司。为此，他放弃了很多东西。\n抬起头，他看向远处正在等待那颗球踢回的孩子。\n他们没有绿茵场，但有片开阔的沙地也够了。\n他们没有球门，但有两个破铁皮罐也够了。\n他们踢球毫无章法，只是乱踢一气，但是快乐就够了。\n拜松突然意识到，他很久都没有只是因为单纯的快乐而做事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "噗嗤——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（所以......这就是答案吗？解释一切的答案？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "（算了，不重要，现在有更重要的事情。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "喂，带我一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那还不把球踢回来，老哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_325_bison_1",
      "text": "小朋友，我之前可是校队主力，这一球你真的可以接住吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "到底还是个孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，你怎么那么久才说话，那家伙现在在干嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "好了，我们的委托完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我要回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只有你在现场，快说到底怎么回事啊？喂喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "回见，我要给委托人回复了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "欧厄尔先生，你可是给我们出了好大一个难题啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不过我们也算是顺利完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "所以现在他在踢足球吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "他好久都没有踢过了啊，还是和几个半大孩子，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "我知道，我知道，他也是个孩子......辛苦诸位了，事后我必然携重礼登门道谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "......为什么我不自己说呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "......好问题啊......这些话我能自己说就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_539_1",
      "text": "可惜不能啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
